297
00:08:05,270 --> 00:08:06,650
What I felt was warmth.

298
00:08:06,690 --> 00:08:08,380
Not a heating pad kind of
hot.

299
00:08:08,540 --> 00:08:09,940
More like it was coming
from inside

300
00:08:09,940 --> 00:08:11,430
