around it.

301
00:08:11,600 --> 00:08:12,410
And that was it.

302
00:08:12,700 --> 00:08:14,360
That was the whole
experience.

303
00:08:14,460 --> 00:08:15,950
When I took it off,

304
00:08:15,950 --> 00:08:17,100
I'll be honest,

305
00:08:17,100 --> 00:08:18,770
nothing dramatic had
happened.

306
00:08:18,810 --> 00:08:20,300
And after what that video
said,

307
00:08:20,300 --> 00:08:22,410
that's exactly what I
expected.

308
00:08:22,700 --> 00:08:23,670
What was different

309
00:08:23,670 --> 00:08:24,740
was that for the first

310
00:08:24,740 --> 00:08:26,260
time in two years

311
00:08:26,260 --> 00:08:28,220
I'd done something for my
knee

312
00:08:28,220 --> 00:08:29,410
