315
00:08:31,510 --> 00:08:33,140
No drive, no copay.

316
00:08:33,180 --> 00:08:34,520
They say twenty minutes.

317
00:08:34,560 --> 00:08:35,760
I did thirty,

318
00:08:35,760 --> 00:08:36,770
twice a day,

319
00:08:36,770 --> 00:08:38,470
lowest setting that first
week.

320
00:08:38,680 --> 00:08:40,420
I put it on the calendar,

321
00:08:40,420 --> 00:08:42,090
