schedule.

322
00:08:42,410 --> 00:08:43,600
The first week,

323
00:08:43,600 --> 00:08:44,480
I couldn't have told

324
00:08:44,480 --> 00:08:45,870
you if anything was
happening.

325
00:08:46,070 --> 00:08:47,040
I tried not to get

326
00:08:47,040 --> 00:08:48,030
