358
00:09:33,450 --> 00:09:34,090
Two.

359
00:09:34,350 --> 00:09:36,830
Inflamed tissue holds
extra fluid,

360
00:09:36,830 --> 00:09:37,760
so it takes up more

361
00:09:37,760 --> 00:09:38,930
