362
00:09:38,970 --> 00:09:39,450
Three.

363
00:09:39,490 --> 00:09:41,360
There's only so much room
in there.

364
00:09:41,400 --> 00:09:42,800
Bending compresses it.

365
00:09:42,870 --> 00:09:44,330
Straightening pulls it
tight.

366
00:09:44,370 --> 00:09:45,580
That's the squeeze.

367
00:09:45,670 --> 00:09:46,290
Four.

368
00:09:46,330 --> 00:09:48,260
Red and near-infrared
light have been

369
00:09:48,260 --> 00:09:50,530
