inflammation,

370
00:09:50,530 --> 00:09:51,880
so the swelling and the
pressure

371
00:09:51,880 --> 00:09:53,170
can come down with it.

372
00:09:53,430 --> 00:09:54,960
In a randomized trial,

373
00:09:54,960 --> 00:09:56,780
patients given light
therapy after

374
00:09:56,780 --> 00:09:58,010
a knee replacement

375
00:09:58,010 --> 00:09:59,380
had less pain,

376
00:09:59,380 --> 00:10:01,230
less swelling and better
early

377
00:10:01,230 --> 00:10:02,890
movement than those who
weren't.

378
00:10:03,240 --> 00:10:06,180
A 2025 review said the
same,

379
00:10:06,180 --> 00:10:07,350
and was clear the evidence

380
00:10:07,350 --> 00:10:08,460
