381
00:10:08,720 --> 00:10:09,950
I probably sound like a
broken

382
00:10:09,950 --> 00:10:11,230
record to my family.

383
00:10:11,720 --> 00:10:13,650
But after two years of
doing everything

384
00:10:13,650 --> 00:10:16,020
I was told and getting
nowhere,

385
00:10:16,020 --> 00:10:17,300
you have no idea what it's

386
00:10:17,300 --> 00:10:18,900
