night,

387
00:10:18,900 --> 00:10:20,450
say yes to the walk,

388
00:10:20,450 --> 00:10:21,880
and get my life back.

389
00:10:21,940 --> 00:10:23,150
So take it from me.

390
00:10:23,440 --> 00:10:24,890
Don't spend another year
waiting

391
00:10:24,890 --> 00:10:25,770
